01291936789025", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12331303_245598725994458_479181173273133056_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tINCuOCYmEsQ7kNvwGwjg_X&_nc_oc=Adp5ldSO9gXKOJTWGMPo0oHBHH8JbGZjXudB8GO2VoibSbD0iJ1jh8P67K03XJzMauk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHLrgiwzzEw-oQ_STrxaYlPevPmD3Wa8weNZrDHpCW9lw&oe=6A92C5BD"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "642658059801509", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139433_425044671239926_4609888145117282304_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C1Lpp-5TX0EQ7kNvwFA2DE4&_nc_oc=Adq8G_6HUhf8dOhoA0sPucKrXkB6tefkEyIDLHJPchgvFlxhWLv4eBw2lnkgQIaCR1M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGxCNj90F_BobRQbgukeGxAQv1He8Ed_8SRnBUq9oS9xw&oe=6A92ABFB"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "619740281913536", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139467_430682997415049_6349888944162734080_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Flh-sghOkc8Q7kNvwHReLQt&_nc_oc=Adp1ESa9nPnJ4xtwW7854vAWRL_zcUIMFUEPlyCbtU3Wc3QyOov8XCG29vAtMw_T8n8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQETTrXxVlINMd-58VCtom8SNCTLhLgOgCK-N9jOBzHLwg&oe=6A92C125"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RotatorX", "keywords": ["Arcade", "Endlessrunner", "SciFi", "Speed", "Fast"], "long_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a dark unique sci-fi atmosphere. Fast paced and addictive - but also meditative. The intuitive controls makes it easy to play - but it's hard to gain. Speed, procedural level design, dynamic lighting FX and an adaptive soundtrack will guarantee a challenging and immersive VR experience.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n* Dynamic lighting FX\n* Adaptive soundtrack\n* Intuitve controls\n* Procedural level design\n\n! Oculus Go only !", "short_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a